  {
   "id": "megaton-musashi-w-wired-241450@major-2024-11-25",
   "gameId": "megaton-musashi-w-wired-241450",
   "displayName": "Summary of the Update for 11/26",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2024-11-25T10:25:51.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "New Online Battle Mode \"Megarobo Batroseum\" added!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "In this mode, you can enjoy a Battle Royale or Team Battles with up to 6 players. Since you choose from pre-customized machines, you can start playing immediately without having to enhance or collect parts. Plus, a new feature, the \"Sengi System,\" is introduced. Join the action in this easy-to-participate online mode and enjoy more intense robot battles than ever before!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "New Feature Exclusive to Megarobo Batroseum: The \"Sengi System\"」",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Each Rogue has a unique power called \"Sengi\" based on its type. Fill up its gauge through actions like attacking, and activate it to use special techniques. For example, the Melee Type can send flying slashes with close-range attacks, while the Ranged Type can create a barrier that nullifies incoming ranged attacks.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "These Sengi can greatly change the course of battle, so utilize them at the right time to claim victory!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Check out the latest PV to see how the Sengi System works!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Legendary Pilots Join the Fight!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Legendary pilots will be available for play in each mission, online play, as well as in Megarobo Batroseum.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "These 5 pilots will join the fray: Koji Kabuto from \"Mazinger Z,\" Ryoma Nagare from \"Getter Robot,\" Duke Fleed from \"Grendizer,\" Hyoma Aoi from \"Combattler V\" and Kenichi Go from \"Voltes V.\"",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "You can also fight with the iconic robots from each of these titles, so we hope you have fun mixing and matching your favorite pilots and robots!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
